		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Bat-faced, white-fleshed fey goblin that perches atop dreaming mortals and crushes the life out of them.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 31, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 claw +2 (1d4) or perch, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +0, <strong>D</strong> +5, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> -1, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Invisibility</strong>. Turn invisible. Doesn't end if alp attacks.</p><p></p><p><strong>Perch</strong>. Squat atop a sleeping mortal, trapping them in a nightmare and crushing them. On turn, WIS 18+ to awaken or 1d6 damage.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
